OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe week's final visit is to
OL,7,     FHazeldene Guest House in Perth,
OL,8,     Frun by hospitality veterans Rob
OL,9,     Fand Glenda. Their plan? Get their
OL,10,     Fguests in good spirits with a trip
OL,11,     Fto a whisky distillery.
OL,12,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's payment day, and time for the
OL,14,     FB&Bers to confront each other
OL,15,     Fabout their stays. There are some
OL,16,     Ffrosty heating comments and
OL,17,     Fbrekkie bombshells before the
OL,18,     Fwinners are revealed.
