OL,11,     Fplace?
OL,12,G1235 A Place in the Sun
OL,13,     FDebra and Greg look for a holiday
OL,14,     Fhome in the beautiful countryside
OL,15,     Fof Murcia, which one day they hope
OL,16,     Fto make their permanent home.
OL,17,     FJasmine Harman shows them what
OL,18,     Ftheir #150k can buy.
