OL,6,     FActor and antiques dealer Robert
OL,7,     FGray hosts at Number 16, in
OL,8,     FGreenwich, London. He charms his
OL,9,     Fguests with his hosting, but Jan
OL,10,     Fand Les find the dusty decor
OL,11,     Foff-putting.
